          <h1 class="article-title">Kitchen Range Hood Static Pressure Guide — Solving High-Rise Building Smoke Issues</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 March 15, 2026</span>
            <span>🏷️ Ventilation Engineering</span>
            <span>⏱️ 6 min read</span>
